{"id":"05d04ddcf190776e","group":"73","path":"73/73-df-nfa-subset-construction.md","title":"NFA 的子集确定化","display":"df-nfa-subset-construction — NFA 的子集确定化","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Introduction to Automata Theory, Languages, and Computation (Hopcroft, Motwani, Ullman; 3rd ed., 2007)","book_abbrev":"73","label":"73-df-nfa-subset-construction","aliases":["73-df-nfa-subset-construction"],"display":"df-nfa-subset-construction — NFA 的子集确定化","depends_on":["[[73-df-nfa-language-semantics]]","[[73-df-dfa-structure]]"],"source_id":"HMU2007","source_ref":"§2.3, print pp. 55–65; PDF pp. 77–87","source_status":"third-edition-topic-mapped; inherited-local-review; not-a-line-by-line-source-proof-certificate","reviewed_on":"2026-10-24","legacy_source_id":"HU1979","legacy_source_ref":"§2.3, Theorem 2.1, pp. 22–23; scans 30–31","legacy_source_status":"book-based-local-formalization","revision_round":"pdf-third-edition-20261024","edition_role":"third-edition-core","third_edition_chapter":2},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Introduction to Automata Theory, Languages, and Computation (Hopcroft, Motwani, Ullman; 3rd ed., 2007)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"73"},{"key":"label","html":"73-df-nfa-subset-construction"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>73-df-nfa-subset-construction</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-nfa-subset-construction — NFA 的子集确定化"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"1d700ea676b35b73\" href=\"?note=1d700ea676b35b73\" title=\"73-df-nfa-language-semantics\">73-df-nfa-language-semantics</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"c0782b725f569c3a\" href=\"?note=c0782b725f569c3a\" title=\"73-df-dfa-structure\">73-df-dfa-structure</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_id","html":"HMU2007"},{"key":"source_ref","html":"§2.3, print pp. 55–65; PDF pp. 77–87"},{"key":"source_status","html":"third-edition-topic-mapped; inherited-local-review; not-a-line-by-line-source-proof-certificate"},{"key":"reviewed_on","html":"2026-10-24"},{"key":"legacy_source_id","html":"HU1979"},{"key":"legacy_source_ref","html":"§2.3, Theorem 2.1, pp. 22–23; scans 30–31"},{"key":"legacy_source_status","html":"book-based-local-formalization"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"pdf-third-edition-20261024"},{"key":"edition_role","html":"third-edition-core"},{"key":"third_edition_chapter","html":"2"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"N=(Q,\\Sigma,\\delta,q_0,F)\\in\\mathsf{NFA}_{\\Sigma}\">\\(N=(Q,\\Sigma,\\delta,q_0,F)\\in\\mathsf{NFA}_{\\Sigma}\\)</span>，其转移和语言见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"1d700ea676b35b73\" href=\"?note=1d700ea676b35b73\" title=\"73-df-nfa-language-semantics\">73-df-nfa-language-semantics</a>。DFA 结构见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"c0782b725f569c3a\" href=\"?note=c0782b725f569c3a\" title=\"73-df-dfa-structure\">73-df-dfa-structure</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\\subseteq Q,a\\in\\Sigma\">\\(S\\subseteq Q,a\\in\\Sigma\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}nfa\\text{-}subset\\text{-}construction}\\vdash\n\\delta_{\\mathcal P}(S,a)\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{q\\in S}\\delta(q,a),\\qquad F_{\\mathcal P}\\coloneqq\\{S\\subseteq Q:S\\cap F\\ne\\varnothing\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}nfa\\text{-}subset\\text{-}construction}\\vdash\n\\delta_{\\mathcal P}(S,a)\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{q\\in S}\\delta(q,a),\\qquad F_{\\mathcal P}\\coloneqq\\{S\\subseteq Q:S\\cap F\\ne\\varnothing\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}nfa\\text{-}subset\\text{-}construction}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Subset}(N)\\coloneqq(\\mathcal P(Q),\\Sigma,\\delta_{\\mathcal P},\\{q_0\\},F_{\\mathcal P}),\\qquad\\operatorname{Subset}(N)\\in\\mathsf{DFA}_{\\Sigma}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}nfa\\text{-}subset\\text{-}construction}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Subset}(N)\\coloneqq(\\mathcal P(Q),\\Sigma,\\delta_{\\mathcal P},\\{q_0\\},F_{\\mathcal P}),\\qquad\\operatorname{Subset}(N)\\in\\mathsf{DFA}_{\\Sigma}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>空状态集也必须保留，其所有后继仍为空集；这保证所得 DFA 转移为全函数。幂集有限且非空。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"73-df-nfa-language-semantics","status":"resolved","id":"1d700ea676b35b73","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-nfa-language-semantics]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-dfa-structure","status":"resolved","id":"c0782b725f569c3a","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-dfa-structure]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-nfa-language-semantics","status":"resolved","id":"1d700ea676b35b73","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$N=(Q,\\Sigma,\\delta,q_0,F)\\in\\mathsf{NFA}_{\\Sigma}$，其转移和语言见 [[73-df-nfa-language-semantics]]。DFA 结构见 [[73-df-dfa-structure]]；$S\\subseteq Q,a\\in\\Sigma$。","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-dfa-structure","status":"resolved","id":"c0782b725f569c3a","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$N=(Q,\\Sigma,\\delta,q_0,F)\\in\\mathsf{NFA}_{\\Sigma}$，其转移和语言见 [[73-df-nfa-language-semantics]]。DFA 结构见 [[73-df-dfa-structure]]；$S\\subseteq Q,a\\in\\Sigma$。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"N=(Q,\\Sigma,\\delta,q_0,F)\\in\\mathsf{NFA}_{\\Sigma}","display":false},{"tex":"S\\subseteq Q,a\\in\\Sigma","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}nfa\\text{-}subset\\text{-}construction}\\vdash\n\\delta_{\\mathcal P}(S,a)\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{q\\in S}\\delta(q,a),\\qquad F_{\\mathcal P}\\coloneqq\\{S\\subseteq Q:S\\cap F\\ne\\varnothing\\}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}nfa\\text{-}subset\\text{-}construction}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Subset}(N)\\coloneqq(\\mathcal P(Q),\\Sigma,\\delta_{\\mathcal P},\\{q_0\\},F_{\\mathcal P}),\\qquad\\operatorname{Subset}(N)\\in\\mathsf{DFA}_{\\Sigma}","display":true}],"bytes":1659,"backlinks":[{"id":"6af52783a9bce985","anchor":"ref-27","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[73-df-nfa-subset-construction|NFA 的子集确定化]]"},{"id":"dca22faafaee72fb","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"最后两个断言固定 $N=(Q,\\Sigma,\\delta,q_0,F)\\in\\mathsf{NFA}_{\\Sigma}$，$\\operatorname{Subset}(N)$ 见 [[73-df-nfa-subset-construction]]。"}],"outgoing":["1d700ea676b35b73","c0782b725f569c3a"]}